Department of Computer Science, and the UPolnicek contributors

UPolnicek is a from-scratch replacement frontend for ReCodEx
(https://github.com/ReCodEx), the programming-assignment evaluation system
developed at the Faculty of Mathematics and Physics, Charles University.
ReCodEx and its original web application are themselves MIT-licensed, and
portions of this project's behaviour -- notably the per-partes upload protocol,
the markdown/KaTeX delimiter rules, the source-file extension-to-language
mapping and the solution evaluation state machine -- were derived by reading
that original implementation in order to preserve compatibility with content and
data already in the database.

